== 3. Source: the two reads in the alert pass ==
cmd/handoff/why.go, deliveries(): deliveryTo(role) is read first, then wait.ReadCursor,
with a test's pause point between them. A listener that takes the lock, delivers and lets
go between the two has written its cursor before it let go, so the second read is past
what it delivered. I read this and did not run the paused case; the implementer's
TestH34p5ANoteDeliveredBetweenTheReadsGetsNoAlert does.

